    <briefdescription>
<para>A module pass for msan instrumentation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Instruments functions to detect unitialized reads. This function pass inserts calls to runtime library functions. If the functions aren&apos;t declared yet, the pass inserts the declarations. Otherwise the existing globals are used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
